	"Description": "Server-authoritative, data-driven multiplayer kart-combat gameplay framework. Provides karts, arcade vehicle movement, health/shield, a validated damage pipeline, data-driven weapons and projectiles, powerups and spawners, inventory, match flow, respawn, teams, scoring, mobile-first input, and a pluggable online session abstraction.",
